From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Ilyin <d.ilyin@openipc.org>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 23:38:39 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] avcodec: add SVAC 3.0 decoding via libsvac3d

Adds AV_CODEC_ID_SVAC3, an access-unit parser, a raw demuxer (.svac,
.svac3) and a decoder wrapper around libsvac3d
(https://github.com/OpenIPC/libsvac3d), which decodes the Main profile
tool set of the GB/T SVAC 3.0 draft.
---
